---Lightning randomly hits entities on planets with [lightning\_properties](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/PlanetPrototype.html%23lightning_properties#lightning_properties).
---
---If a [lightning attractor](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/LightningAttractorPrototype.html) is hit by lightning it will absorb the lightning hit for energy.
---
---If a something that is not an attractor is hit by lightning it will be damaged by the strike.
